      <memberdef kind="function" id="group__grp__i2c_1ga64c71e2587dfe3b42d37bd356dd021a0" prot="public" static="yes" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>void</type>
        <definition>static void I2C1_BusRecovery</definition>
        <argsstring>(void)</argsstring>
        <name>I2C1_BusRecovery</name>
        <param>
          <type>void</type>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Sequence de recuperation du bus I2C1 (PB8=SCL, PB9=SDA) en cas de bus bloque (SDA maintenu bas par un esclave en plein transfert interrompu). Reconfigure temporairement les broches en GPIO, genere jusqu&apos;a 9 fronts d&apos;horloge pour forcer l&apos;esclave a liberer SDA, emet une condition STOP manuelle, puis restaure la configuration I2C normale. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Aucun.</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para></para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<parameterlist kind="retval"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Aucun</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>(void). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Exemple d&apos;utilisation</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">Appeler<sp/>UNE<sp/>FOIS<sp/>juste<sp/>avant<sp/>MX_I2C1_Init()<sp/>dans<sp/>main(),</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">si<sp/>HAL_I2C_IsDeviceReady()<sp/>renvoie<sp/>systematiquement<sp/>HAL_BUSY.</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
